{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"移除 toggleLanguage 里对已删除的 user-role-select 的操作（select 已换成只读徽章），改为更新角色徽章的国际化文本。","EndLine":1398,"Instruction":"替换 toggleLanguage 中读取 role-select 的代码。","ReplacementContent":"\n      // 更新角色标签文字（国际化）\n      const roleLabelEl = document.getElementById('role-label');\n      if (roleLabelEl) roleLabelEl.textContent = currentLang === 'zh' ? '当前登录角色' : 'Current Role';\n      // 更新角色徽章文字\n      updateRoleBadge(getCurrentRole());\n\n      switchDepartment(currentDept, document.querySelector(`.sidebar .active`));\n    }\n","StartLine":1391,"TargetContent":"\n      const roleSelect = document.getElementById('user-role-select');\n      const val = roleSelect.value;\n      roleSelect.options[0].text = dict.role_admin;\n      roleSelect.options[1].text = dict.role_editor;\n      roleSelect.options[2].text = dict.role_sales;\n      roleSelect.value = val;\n\n      switchDepartment(currentDept, document.querySelector(`.sidebar .active`));\n    }\n","TargetFile":"/Volumes/MOVESPEED/下载/AIcode/Agent/index.html","toolAction":"Fixing toggleLanguage role select reference","toolSummary":"Fix toggleLanguage"}Jreplace_file_content`